sky is served here."},{"id":"marker6","name":"The Red Scorpion","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious smoked scorpion with amber spirits is served here."},{"id":"marker7","name":"The Light Crow","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious cured carrot with sparkling liquor is served here."},{"id":"marker8","name":"The Red Badger","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious stewed garlic with sparkling nectar is served here."},{"id":"marker9","name":"The Beautiful Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious mashed pudding with misty beer is served here."},{"id":"marker10","name":"The Giant Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious poached bacon with ice mead is served here."},{"id":"marker11","name":"The Purple Lark","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious braised cheese with light mead is served here."},{"id":"marker12","name":"The Main Owl","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious pan-fried antlers with sweet milk is served here."},{"id":"marker13","name":"Queruerian Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker14","name":"Puerrian Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker15","name":"Nikka Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Kogo War. \r\nDate: July 1, 1413 Preston Era."},{"id":"marker16","name":"Turonaberga Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Aberow War. \r\nDate: March 3, 1441 Preston Era."},{"id":"marker17","name":"Aberclesws Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Aseian Campaign. \r\nDate: May 30, 1439 Preston Era."},{"id":"marker18","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=525410187984\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=525410187984\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker19","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=5254101872924\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=5254101872924\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker20","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=5254101873226\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=5254101873226\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker21","name":"Dymouthes Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 31 m long."},{"id":"marker22","name":"Arkeithynve Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Keltan Deities."},{"id":"marker23","name":"Afonnerkip Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Keltan Deities."},{"id":"marker24","name":"Obornov Owls","legend":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"id":"marker25","name":"Bodilepiros Snakes","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker26","name":"Dinnvercast Dogs","legend":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"id":"marker27","name":"Tonyhadhavas Apes","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker28","name":"Miras Hawks","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker29","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker30","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker31","name":"Kismiz Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡓᠪᠻᡗᡒᡰᡱ᠐ᡓᠡᡞᠲᠼᢂᢀᠱᡕᢢᠨᢠᢁᠠᡓᠻᡠᢥᡁᠼᠽᡲᢤᡍᠩᠮᡐᠵᡔᢁ᠒ᢒᢥᠾᡐᡕᡙᡗᠾᡓᢦᢦᡠᡐᢟᢓᡡᢤᡙ᠒ᡟᠱᡞᡆ᠑ᠾ</div>"},{"id":"marker32","name":"Ostkamev Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢜᢂᡠᡝᡴᡖᡐᢠᡞᠦᢜᡐᠮᢁᢜᢠᠡᢂᠰᢦᢋᠦᠧᠻᡖᠯᢒᡮᡆᠰᡍᢤᡍᠩᢜᠮᠿᡯᠯᡗᡠ᠒ᢒᠿᡯᡝᠱᡟᢀᠿᡳᢐᢁᡟᠻᡝᢐᠼ᠑ᡮᡠᠾᢑᢢᡖᡰᢢᠾᡁᡑᠠᢁᡁᠰᢁᡎᡑᡜᠽᠲᡭᢏᡮᡝᢞᡖᠦᡆᠪᢥᠱᡯᢟᡍᡮᠻ᠑ᡟᢀ</div>"},{"id":"marker33","name":"Tuuski Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢑᡓᢒᠠᡐᡝᡁᡖᢥᢡᡔᠧᠮᠿᢢᡟᢜᢤᠦᡳᡱᢜᠿᠽᡠᡑᡰᢦᠼᠿᡜᢐᡲᠵᠧᢠᡗᠳᠵᡗᠰᡎᢓᡏᠯᢑᡆᢀᡏᠨᢒᡐᡱ᠐ᡀᡝᢜᢒᡎᡑᡕᢜ</div>"},{"id":"marker34","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker35","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker36","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker37","name":"Saras Collection","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker38","name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker39","name":"Travelling Wonderous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wonderous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker40","name":"Csormatlora Melee","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a melee of brutality in Csormatlora, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker41","name":"Alainwyrmuno Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Alainwyrmuno, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker42","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Fuzesleny River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker43","name":"Ibises migration","legend":"A huge group of ibises are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker44","name":"Mstis Crypt","legend":"An eerie necropolis where nature intertwines with death. Overgrown tombstones are entwined by thorny vines, and mournful spirits wander among the fading petals of once-vibrant flowers."},{"id":"marker45","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1526\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker46","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2730\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker47","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3305\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker48","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1513\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker49","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/425\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker50","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3956\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"}]
